                                "sense_id": "2f408fb9-6f23-3127-a824-777845a56f3d",
                                "text": "Nomore then it lyeth in the libertye of the liuelye tre wel planted to ceaſſe frome bringing forth hir frutes in hir time / except God altereth this his natural ordinaunce bi ſome ſingler gifte."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6cd84e3-0e05-431d-8899-9df2655bc831",
                                "sense_id": "2f408fb9-6f23-3127-a824-777845a56f3d",
                                "text": "In doing whereof there neither wanted polycie in him ſelf, nor yet ſingler manhode in his men."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b14b8865-7ce0-4117-a79d-03b1bdd6c6d6",
                                "sense_id": "2f408fb9-6f23-3127-a824-777845a56f3d",
                                "text": "But Maximilian reteyning ſtill a ſingler ambition in this iorney, would admit no companion or communitie of name or authoritie[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
